WEBVTT

1
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:12,460
Am I still awake? Why is Shen Yan here?

2
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:20,330
Ayu, it was me who was not good in the past

3
00:00:20,330 --> 00:00:26,140
I have always been cold-tempered and not affectionate

4
00:00:26,140 --> 00:00:28,140
About once working hard to alienate others

5
00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:31,140
Everyone else thought I forced myself into this marriage.

6
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:34,140
I just obeyed my mother's wishes and hastily agreed to the Duke's request.

7
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:36,140
Never

8
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:38,140
If it weren't for you, I wouldn't let it go

9
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:40,140
Now you feel uncomfortable

10
00:00:40,140 --> 00:00:44,140
In the final analysis, it's just the affection you want from him

11
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:46,140
Just more and more
